superswitcher (0.9.3-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix wrong popup window width adjustment after display arrangement changes.

    Previously, if you changed your monitor setup (for example, by adding,
    removing, rearranging displays, or simply changing screen definition)
    while SuperSwitcher was running, it would not be notified of the new
    arrangement. As a result, popups and window switching would use
    outdated information about your screens until you restarted
    SuperSwitcher. The most noticeable impact was too wide or too narrow
    SuperSwitcher window. With this update, SuperSwitcher ensures its
    interface and features always match your current monitor
    configuration.

 -- Stéphane Gourichon <stephane.gourichon@fidergo.fr>  Thu, 01 May 2025 18:51:59 +0200

